            <abstract>
                <p>This note in Amharic explains the history of the Russian and the Ethiopian Churches since the Council of Chalcedon. It is a 
                    translation of memoranda, sent by <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7548Nerazzin">
                   Cesare
                  Nerazzini
               </persName> from Ethiopia to the Italian Ministry of Foreign Affairs.
                    The text has been translated from Italian into Amharic either by <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3182ContiRo">Carlo Conti Rossini</persName> or by 
                    <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7548Nerazzin">
                   Cesare
                  Nerazzini
               </persName>. Cf.
                    <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/BQP5ISA4"><seg type="document"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Nerazzini1895Note"/><title level="m">Note storiche sul Concilio di Calcedonia, e analisi delle differenze dogmatiche fra la Chiesa russa e la Chiesa etiopica</title><author><forename>Cesare</forename><surname>Nerazzini</surname></author><pubPlace>Rom</pubPlace><date>1895</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Nerazzini1895Note</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Nerazzini1895Note</note></bibl> and <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/ZEY9RWZG"><seg type="document"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:NerazziniDifferenza"/><title level="m">Differenza fra la religione cristiana etiopica e quella moscovita ortodossa</title><author><forename>Cesare</forename><surname>Nerazzini</surname></author><pubPlace>no place</pubPlace><date>1895</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:NerazziniDifferenza</note></note><note type="tag">bm:NerazziniDifferenza</note></bibl>.</p>
            </abstract>
